        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        165.70833668300656,
        977.8111768308081,
        521.5198794117647,
        10.774146433080809
      ],
      "text": "Implementing the IBM Storwize V7000 with IBM Spectrum Virtualize V8.2.1",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        92.35864741161629,
        80.27959109477118,
        14.365582070706978
      ],
      "text": "Event ID",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        111.95882165404055,
        687.4125653594771,
        11.923403093434217
      ],
      "text": "An event ID is a value that is used to identify a unique error condition that was detected by the ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        127.48887878787878,
        591.8703055555555,
        11.923416035353625
      ],
      "text": "Storwize V7000. An event ID is used internally in the cluster to identify the error.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        160.92498705808077,
        185.3582030228758,
        14.365582070707205
      ],
      "text": "Excluded condition",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        180.52516130050503,
        661.5849771241831,
        11.923403093434445
      ],
      "text": "The excluded condition is a status condition. It describes an MDisk that the IBM Storwize ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        196.05523137626267,
        685.9216258169936,
        11.923403093434331
      ],
      "text": "V7000 decided is no longer sufficiently reliable to be managed by the cluster. The user must ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        211.585288510101,
        531.2818353758171,
        11.923403093434445
      ],
      "text": "issue a command to include the MDisk in the cluster-managed storage. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        245.0992035984849,
        61.33519607843138,
        14.365582070707092
      ],
      "text": "Extent",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        264.69937784090916,
        663.6434517973855,
        11.923403093434331
      ],
      "text": "An extent is a fixed-size unit of data that is used to manage the mapping of data between ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        280.2294349747475,
        513.7763929738562,
        11.923416035353625
      ],
      "text": "MDisks and volumes. The size of the extent can range 16 MB - 8 GB.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        313.6654655934344,
        157.30735294117645,
        14.365582070706978
      ],
      "text": "External storage",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        333.2656398358587,
        672.4828541666667,
        11.923403093434331
      ],
      "text": "External storage refers to MDisks that are SCSI logical units that are presented by storage ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        348.7956969696969,
        502.56810171568634,
        11.923416035353625
      ],
      "text": "systems that are attached to and managed by the clustered system.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        382.3094567550505,
        80.41629125816993,
        14.36554324494955
      ],
      "text": "Failback",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        401.8320183080808,
        668.0873292483659,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "Failback is the restoration of an appliance to its initial configuration after the detection and ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        417.36208838383845,
        295.0952222222222,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "repair of a failed network or component.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        450.8757575757576,
        77.05988521241832,
        14.36554324494955
      ],
      "text": "Failover",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        470.47593181818183,
        687.3776952614379,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "Failover is an automatic operation that switches to a redundant or standby system or node in ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        486.0059889520202,
        478.1780424836601,
        11.92337720959597
      ],
      "text": "a software, hardware, or network interruption. See also Failback.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        519.4420583964647,
        224.45895506535945,
        14.365543244949492
      ],
      "text": "Feature activation code",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        539.0422326388889,
        515.6430653594772,
        11.923364267676675
      ],
      "text": "An alphanumeric code that activates a licensed function on a product.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        572.5556688762626,
        243.36914991830068,
        14.365543244949492
      ],
      "text": "Fibre Channel port logins",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        592.078230429293,
        638.3026548202615,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "FC port logins refer to the number of hosts that can see any one V7000 port. The IBM ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        607.6083005050505,
        604.7364170751634,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "Storwize V7000 has a maximum limit per node port of FC logins that are allowed. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        641.1219696969697,
        206.4571245915033,
        14.365543244949492
      ],
      "text": "Field-replaceable unit",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        660.7221439393941,
        687.5226523692811,
        11.923364267676675
      ],
      "text": "Field-replaceable units (FRUs) are individual parts that are replaced entirely when any one of ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        676.2522010732323,
        649.3626727941177,
        11.923377209595913
      ],
      "text": "the unit\u2019s components fails. They are held as spares by the IBM service organization. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        709.6882575757576,
        102.72310498366008,
        14.36551736111113
      ],
      "text": "FlashCopy",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        729.2884447601011,
        661.6249387254901,
        11.923390151515093
      ],
      "text": "FlashCopy refers to a point-in-time copy where a virtual copy of a volume is created. The ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        744.8184889520203,
        671.9807381535948,
        11.92339015151515
      ],
      "text": "target volume maintains the contents of the volume at the point in time when the copy was ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        760.3485331439394,
        678.379535130719,
        11.92339015151515
      ],
      "text": "established. Any subsequent write operations to the source volume are not reflected on the ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        775.8785773358586,
        106.00848120915029,
        11.92339015151515
      ],
      "text": "target volume.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        809.3928159722223,
        191.92021282679738,
        14.365517361111102
      ],
      "text": "FlashCopy mapping",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        828.9929772727273,
        643.7025290032681,
        11.923390151515122
      ],
      "text": "A FlashCopy mapping is a continuous space on a direct-access storage volume that is ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11768055555555,
        844.5230214646465,
        500.7481907679738,
        11.92339015151515
      ],
      "text": "occupied by or reserved for a particular data set, data space, or file.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        877.959090909091,
        222.014983251634,
        14.365530303030283
      ],
      "text": "FlashCopy relationship",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        897.5592612689394,
        188.0540870098039,
        11.92339662247474
      ],
      "text": "See FlashCopy mapping.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    }
  ]
}